============================================================
Provenance
============================================================

This repository is the patent-scoped subset of the broader
spiking neuron library at:

    https://github.com/DrCanD/dikmen-spiking-neurons

That repository contains 39 neuron models across 8 families;
this one contains the 17 models covered by 2026/007632 plus the
TH-LIF CUDA kernel and Arty A7-35T FPGA measurements.
